        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Signet Jewelers, Zale Corporation, Sterling Jewelers, Zales, Kay Jewelers, Jared\n- People: Theo Killion\n- Roles: CEO\n\nFacts:\n- Sterling Jewelers was acquired by UK-based Signet Jewelers Limited in 1987 and is a wholly owned subsidiary of Signet Jewelers Limited.\n- Zale Corporation is an American jewelry retailer that was incorporated in Delaware in 1993.\n- Theo Killion, also known as Theophlius Killion, served as CEO of Zale Corporation from February 2010 to July 2014.\n- Signet Jewelers owns and operates the companies Zales, Kay Jewelers, and Jared.\n- Signet Jewelers Limited is listed on the New York Stock Exchange under the symbol SIG.",
